# Store text files with LF in the repository, whatever platform they were
# written on. Without this a checkout configured for CRLF rewrites every line
# of a file it touches, and the diff shows the whole file as changed with the
# real edit buried in it (flower-card PR #324 was 943 changed lines hiding 174).
# "text=auto" leaves git to detect binary files and leave them alone.
* text=auto eol=lf
